pecifies seeds 0-9, but run used seed=43) caught my attention. However:\n- This is handled in code: the `--seed` CLI argument overrides the config\n- The resolved config correctly shows `seed: 43`\n- This is intentional behavior, not a bug\n\n### Conclusion\nAll indicators suggest this is a **healthy run**:\n- Code is correct and deterministic\n- Configuration is reasonable and applied properly\n- Metrics are clean and show expected behavior for a 42% label-noise setting\n- Training completed successfully\n- No errors, warnings, or anomalies in logs\n- The flat learning curve is expected given the high noise fraction",
